\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to = ar\u00e1nyos valamivel (pl. The reward was _______ to the effort.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 directly _______ = egyenesen ar\u00e1nyos (pl. The risk is directly _______ to the potential gain.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 inversely _______ = ford\u00edtottan ar\u00e1nyos (pl. Price is often inversely _______ to demand.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ representation = ar\u00e1nyos k\u00e9pviselet (pl. Many countries use a system of _______ representation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>proportional<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>proportional<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>proportionally<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>proportion<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: proportional to \/ directly proportional \/ inversely proportional \/ proportional representation<\/span><\/p><p>similar: commensurate \/ corresponding \/ equivalent \/ comparable<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: disproportionate \/ unbalanced \/ unequal<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"proportional\nproportionally","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"new","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null,"due_at":null,"previous_state":null},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":null},{"id":51348,"front":"<p>I thought he was joking, but _______, he was completely serious. <em>(val\u00f3j\u00e1ban \/ t\u00e9nylegesen)<\/em><\/p><p>Many people believe that organic food is always healthier, but _______, the nutritional differences are often negligible. <em>(tulajdonk\u00e9ppen \/ az igazat megvallva)<\/em><\/p><p>The report suggests a significant improvement in sales. _______, our market share has slightly decreased. <em>(azonban \/ ellenben)<\/em><\/p><p>She claimed to be an expert in ancient history, but _______, her knowledge w