a cabinet _______, replacing several key ministers. <em>(korm\u00e1ny\u00e1talak\u00edt\u00e1s \/ szem\u00e9lyi v\u00e1ltoztat\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>We need to _______ our priorities for the next quarter to focus on the most critical projects. <em>(\u00e1trendez \/ \u00fajraoszt)<\/em><\/p><p>The company underwent a major internal _______, leading to new departmental structures and reporting lines. <em>(\u00e1tszervez\u00e9s \/ struktur\u00e1lis v\u00e1ltoztat\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">\u00e1tszervez \/ \u00e1talak\u00edt \/ \u00e1trendez<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): stabiliz\u00e1l \/ fenntart \/ megtart<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 cabinet _______ = korm\u00e1ny\u00e1talak\u00edt\u00e1s (pl. The recent cabinet _______ caused a stir in political circles.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a major _______ = egy jelent\u0151s \u00e1tszervez\u00e9s (pl. The company announced a major _______ of its management team.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ priorities = priorit\u00e1sokat \u00e1trendezni (pl. We need to _______ priorities to meet the new deadlines.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ the deck = \u00fajraosztani a lapokat (\u00e1tvitt \u00e9rtelemben) (pl. It&#039;s time to _______ the deck and try a new approach.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>reshuffle<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>reshuffle<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>reshuffle<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: cabinet reshuffle \/ government reshuffle \/ major reshuffle \/ team reshuffle<\/span><\/p><p>similar: reorganize \/ restructure \/ rearrange \/ realign<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: maintain \/ preserve \/ stabilize<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":1,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":"2026-05-22","reviewed_on":"2026-05-22","due_at":"2026-05-22T14:07:58+00:00","previous_state":{"state":"new","due_at":null,"interval":0,"ease_factor":250,"repetitions":0,"lapses":0,"learning_step":0,"is_leech":false,"introduced_on":null,"reviewed_on":null}},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-22T14:07:33+00:00"},{"id":51348,"front":"<p>I thought he was joking, but _______, he was completely serious. <em>(val\u00f3j\u00e1ban \/ t\u00e9nylegesen)<\/em><\/p><p>Many people believe that organic food is always healthier, but _______, the nutritional differences are often negligible. <em>(tulajdonk\u00e9ppen \/ az igazat megvallva)<\/em><\/p><p>The report suggests a significant improvement in sales. _______, our market share has slightly decreased. <em>(azonban \/ ellenben)<\/em><\/p><p>She claimed to be an expert in ancient history, but _______, her knowledge was quite superficial. <em>(a val\u00f3s\u00e1gban \/ ami azt illeti)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">val\u00f3j\u00e1ban \/ t\u00e9nylegesen \/ tulajdonk\u00e9ppen<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elm\u00e9letileg \/ l\u00e1tsz\u00f3lag \/ \u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3lag<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______, I think... = Val\u00f3j\u00e1ban azt hiszem... (pl. In fact, I think we should reconsider the whole plan.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 but _______ = de val\u00f3j\u00e1ban (pl. He said he was busy, but in fact, he was just watching TV.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______, it&#039;s quite the opposite. = S\u0151t, \u00e9pp az ellenkez\u0151je. (pl. Many people think it&#039;s easy, but in fact, it&#039;s quite the opposite.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______, we need to... = A val\u00f3s\u00e1gban sz\u00fcks\u00e9g\u00fcnk van arra, hogy... (pl. In fact, 